    <header class="guide-hero" id="help-top">
        <div class="guide-kicker">A guide for students &amp; parents</div>
        <h1>Let’s take it one step at a time.</h1>
        <p>You do not need computer experience to use the student portal. This guide explains where to go, what to press, what the information means, and what to do when something does not look right.</p>
        <p>If you are a parent or guardian, use the access arrangements provided by the school. The information displayed belongs to the student account currently signed in.</p>
        <div class="guide-links"><a href="#getting-started">Start here</a><a href="#troubleshooting">Something is not working</a><NavLink href="/portal/rules">Read the school rules</NavLink></div>
    </header>

